- [Mail](https://github.com/aiwatchtowers/watchtower/blob/main/docs/guide/features/mail.md) — what Gmail, Outlook and IMAP mail feeds into Catch Up, briefings, meeting prep and Ideas

## Execution

- [Targets](https://github.com/aiwatchtowers/watchtower/blob/main/docs/guide/features/targets.md) — your own to-do list, with a next step per target and an assistant that breaks work down on your instruction
- [Tracks](https://github.com/aiwatchtowers/watchtower/blob/main/docs/guide/features/tracks.md) — the requests and decisions waiting on you, pulled out of Slack digests, plus custom watches on topics you describe
- [Jira and Linear](https://github.com/aiwatchtowers/watchtower/blob/main/docs/guide/features/jira-and-linear.md) — see stuck, late and overloaded work across your Jira boards, and connect Linear

## Insights

- [Digests](https://github.com/aiwatchtowers/watchtower/blob/main/docs/guide/features/digests.md) — per-channel, daily, mail, Jira and meeting summaries in one feed, with a journal of decisions
